&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
We&#39;re hiring Associate Data Scientists with a background in Operations Research. You will own the entire process: from ideation and research through to production deployment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You&#39;ll join either our Pricing or Matching team, working alongside other Data Scientists and engineers on challenging, high-impact problems such as dynamic pricing and bipartite matching.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, Data Scientists, designers, and product managers to solve ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, prototype, and ship ML and optimisation models into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve existing algorithms and identify opportunities for new ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s or PhD in Operations Research, Mathematics, Management Science or a closely related field with a focus on optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in mathematical optimisation or mathematical programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of probability &amp;amp; statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Reinforcement Learning and Casual Inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent programming skills in Python and core ML tooling (e.g. SQL,&amp;nbsp;PyTorch, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to dynamic pricing, auction design, or marketplace matching problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publication in Q1/A* journals, participation in NeurIPS and other conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £50,000 – £70,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor is our newest brand - a healthy, ready-to-eat meal delivery service, and one of the fastest-growing parts of the HelloFresh Group’s European business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Supply Chain Operations Manager (alle genders) to lead our Procurement Operations function and ensure our supply chain is running efficiently, scalable, and commercially effective. You&#39;ll oversee the end-to-end procurement operations process, optimise inventory and supplier performance, and continuously improve the systems and processes that keep our production running smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working cross-functionally with Planning, Production, Finance, Culinary, and Operations, you&#39;ll play a key role in ensuring the right products are available at the right time, while driving operational excellence and supporting Factor&#39;s continued growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Lead and develop our Procurement Operations team, responsible for purchasing, supplier coordination, inventory management, and waste reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end procurement operations process, ensuring ingredients and packaging are delivered On Time, In Full, and In Quality (OTIFQ) to support uninterrupted production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive inventory governance, ensuing product availability and operational efficiency while minimising waste and stock risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion our zero-waste strategy through continuous optimisation of purchasing parameters, inventory controls, and forecasting inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Planning, Finance, Supply Chain, Culinary, and Production to optimize purchasing strategies and ensure smooth day-to-day operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor procurement KPIs, purchasing data, and system accuracy, using insights to identify trends, resolve discrepancies, and drive operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate, simplify, and standardise procurement and inventory processes through data, technology, and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reporting and dashboards that provide clear visibility of procurement performance, inventory health, supplier performance, and key operational KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of continuous improvement, operational excellence, and data-driven decision making across Procurement Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5-6 years of relevant work experience in a Supply Chain, Operations, Procurement or Production field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stress resilience and a hands-on approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, data-driven, and result-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility for occasional weekend work and travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, able to work across different teams and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (German knowledge is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom to initiate, execute and implement your own ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lots of learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24&amp;nbsp; holidays based on 40 hours per week per year, pro rata&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid work setup - with roughly 2 days in our Amsterdam office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of travel expenses to the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount on your ClassPass subscription, and a discount for your gym membership via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount on your additional health insurance through Zilveren Kruis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A discount on your weekly, Factor, HelloFresh and/or Green Chef box in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy lunches, fruit and snacks in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social activities with our culturally diverse team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
